              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಆ ಆಟಗಾರನ ಆತ್ಮಕಥೆ ತುಂಬಾ ಜನಪ್ರಿಯವಾಯಿತು. ā āṭagārana ātmakathe tumbā janapriyavāyitu. That player's autobiography became very popular."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: ಆತ್ಮಕಥೆಗಳು, ātmakathegaḷu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಆತ್ಮ, self, and ಕಥೆ, story: the story of oneself."
            }
          ]
        },
