              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪುಸ್ತಕದ ಪೀಠಿಕೆಯನ್ನು ಲೇಖಕರ ಸ್ನೇಹಿತ ಬರೆದನು. pustakada pīṭhikeyannu lēkhakara snēhita baredanu. The book's preface was written by the author's friend."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The opening part that comes before the story; also the background to a talk."
            }
          ]
        },
